Subject: [PATCH 1/4] dt-bindings: phy: hisilicon,inno-usb2-phy: add
 Hi3798MV200

The USB2 ports on Hi3798MV200 have no test port, so they need a
compatible of their own rather than the generic one.

Signed-off-by: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/phy/hisilicon,inno-usb2-phy.yaml         | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/hisilicon,inno-usb2-phy.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/hisilicon,inno-usb2-phy.yaml
@@ -19,6 +19,7 @@ properties:
     enum:
       - hisilicon,hi3798cv200-usb2-phy
       - hisilicon,hi3798mv100-usb2-phy
+      - hisilicon,hi3798mv200-usb2-phy
       - hisilicon,inno-usb2-phy
 
   reg:
